---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy · ${SITE_NAME}`}
  description="How Wealth Sim handles your data."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-sans text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 2026-10-04</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">1. What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Wealth Sim is a local-first tool. The scenario you design is stored in your own
          browser\u2019s localStorage on your device. We do not operate accounts, and we do not
          collect, transmit, or sell your financial inputs.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">2. Currency data</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          When you use currency conversion, exchange rates are fetched at runtime from a public
          data source (Frankfurter, ECB reference rates). Your inputs are not sent to that source;
          only a currency pair is requested.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">3. Analytics</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          The landing page may use basic, privacy-friendly analytics to count visits. It does not
          track you across sites or build advertising profiles.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">4. Third-party links</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          Some persona data references public sources. We are not responsible for the privacy
          practices of those external sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">5. Your control</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          You can clear your stored scenarios at any time by clearing your browser data for this
          site. No account deletion is needed because we never hold your data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-ink">6. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted">
          For privacy questions, contact us via the GitHub repository linked on this site.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
